        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a17dc2e4010d43f59aa27c33c5fa4082",
      "statement": "The global percentage is bucketed into four verbatim French levels — Excellent at 90 or above, Acceptable at 70, Insuffisant at 50, and Inadapté below — and Inadapté is also assigned directly by the run orchestration to unreadable and failed documents.",
