    },
    {
      "id": "claim_357233825d804338b1c68eaaf07972ea",
      "statement": "Every exported cell passes through a sanitizer that prefixes an apostrophe to any string beginning with =, +, - or @, neutralizing spreadsheet formula injection from text extracted out of untrusted PDFs, and applied to both the workbook and the CSV outputs.",
