      "id": "claim_ae706600ed474e9487d933d02735c4a4",
      "statement": "CSV exports use a semicolon delimiter written through csv.writer so values containing the delimiter, quotes or line breaks are quoted rather than corrupting column structure, and are encoded utf-8-sig specifically so Excel renders accented characters correctly.",
