      "id": "claim_f2578f365a124734a17f5708efb16681",
      "statement": "Exact duplicate detection buckets documents by the SHA-256 of their whitespace-normalized lowercased text, so two files with different names but identical content are grouped, and any bucket with more than one member is reported as a duplicate group.",
